\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a rope on the dead tree.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the falls.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the crate in the east room for a key.\"},{\"t\":\"Go through the doors from the west room.\",\"i\":[\"Key\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Arianwyn.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Baxtorian.\"}],\"i\":[\"Rope\",\"Irit leaf or a flower\",\"Cabbage\",\"Wine of Zamorak or Zamorak brew\",\"Nature rune\",\"Adamant chainbody\",\"Black knife or black dagger\"],\"tr\":[\"Teleport crystal\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Arianwyn (level 182)\"]},{\"n\":\"Finding Amlodd\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Arianwyn in Lletya.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Elena in the south west of Lletya.\",\"s\":[\"Now's not the time for stories, Elena.\"],\"i\":[\"Seed dibber\",\"Cadantine seed\"]},{\"t\":\"Plant a cadantine seed in the Lletya farm patch.\",\"i\":[\"Seed dibber\",\"Cadantine seed\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Baxtorian in Lletya.\",\"s\":[\"How do I find Lord Amlodd?\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Eluned in Lletya.\",\"s\":[\"I have a seed from Baxtorian that I think needs enchanting.\"]},{\"t\":\"Rub the crystal seed to teleport.\",\"i\":[\"Crystal seed\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Mysterious Figure.\"}],\"i\":[\"Seed dibber\",\"Cadantine seed\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Arianwyn (level 182)\"]},{\"n\":\"Finding Trahaearn\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Baxtorian in Lletya about Trahaearn.\",\"s\":[\"How do I find Lady Trahaearn?\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the cave to the Underground Pass from the Elven Lands entrance.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\",\"Hammer\",\"Runite bar\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a pickaxe on the wall south of the Well of Voyage.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the hole in the wall.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a hammer on the elderly elf.\",\"i\":[\"Hammer\",\"Runite bar\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lady Tangwen Trahararn.\"}],\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\",\"Hammer\",\"Runite bar\"]},{\"n\":\"Making the potion\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Elena in the south west of Lletya.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Arianwyn in Lletya.\",\"i\":[\"Elder cadantine\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a pestle and mortar on the crystal.\",\"i\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Crystal\"]},{\"t\":\"Add the cadantine to a vial of water.\",\"i\":[\"Elder cadantine\",\"Vial of water\"]},{\"t\":\"Add the crystal dust to a cadantine potion.\",\"i\":[\"Crystal dust\",\"Elder cadantine potion (unf)\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the potion to Arianwyn.\",\"i\":[\"Inversion potion\"]}],\"i\":[\"Pestle and mortar\",\"Vial of water\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Arianwyn (level 182)\"]},{\"n\":\"Entering the Crystal\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Lord Amlodd in Lletya.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Touch the Seal of the Forgotten.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"or more Stamina potions (6)\"]},{\"n\":\"Ithell Seal\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Rotate the mirrors in the pillars in the south east room along the marked path until the light reaches the Seal of Ithell.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Touch the Seal of Ithell in the south east room.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Finding Crwys and Hefin\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Leave the library. A quick way to do this is hopping worlds.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Arianwyn in Lletya.\"},{\"t\":\"Ask Baxtorian about how to find Crwys and Lady Hefin.\",\"s\":[\"How do I find Lord Crwys?\"]},{\"t\":\"Hop across the stepping stones in the swamp south of the magic trees near Lletya. Talk to the Elf Hermit on the island you reach.\"},{\"t\":\"Make your way to the north west of Isafdar, and chop a tree there. Talk to Crwys when he appears.\",\"i\":[\"Any axe\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lord Crwys.\"}],\"i\":[\"Any axe\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Arianwyn (level 182)\"]},{\"n\":\"Retrieving the orb\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Baxtorian in Lletya.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the cave in the Iorwerth camp.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the guards.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the chest for the orb.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Locating Ysgawyn\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Elena in the south west of Lletya.\",\"s\":[\"That's fair. Anyway, I wanted to ask you about Ysgawyn.\"]},{\"t\":\"Inspect the mushrooms just outside Lletya.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the rocks to the west.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the rocks to the west over the tripwire.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the elven lamp to the south over the leaf trap.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the mushrooms to the west.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the rocks to the north west.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb over the tripwire into the clearing.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ysgawyn.\",\"s\":[\"So what have you been discussing?\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Defending Lletya\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter Lletya.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the table to the south for Eoin.\"},{\"t\":\"Go upstairs.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the nearby cooking pots.\"},{\"t\":\"Defeat Arianwyn. Protect from Ranged. Move when he shoots orange arrows.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Arianwyn (level 182)\"]},{\"n\":\"Finding Ithell and Meilyr\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Baxtorian in Lletya about Ithell and Meilyr.\",\"s\":[\"What's Lady Ithell's clue?\"]},{\"t\":\"Touch the symbol on the bank's wall.\"},{\"t\":\"Touch the symbol in the building north of Elena.\"},{\"t\":\"Touch the symbol in the General Store.\"},{\"t\":\"Go up to the top floor of Lletya.\"},{\"t\":\"Touch the symbol above the General Store.\"},{\"t\":\"Touch the symbol at the altar.\"},{\"t\":\"Make a statue in the middle of Lletya.\",\"i\":[\"Saw\",\"Hammer\",\"Limestone brick (8)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lady Kelyn Ithell in Lletya.\"},{\"t\":\"Dig at the marked spot near Port Tyras.\"},{\"t\":\"Dig at the marked spot in Zul-Andra.\"},{\"t\":\"Dig outside Prifiddinas's south gate.\"},{\"t\":\"Spin outside of the Underground Pass's cave entrance with nothing equipped.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lady Meilyr.\"}],\"i\":[\"Limestone brick (8)\",\"Saw\",\"Hammer\",\"Spade\",\"Combat gear, food and potions\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Defending the Temple\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the Underground Pass from the Elven Lands entrance, and make your way to the dwarven camp. Make sure you're prepared for battle.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Baxtorian in the dwarven camp.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Elena in the dwarven camp.\",\"s\":[\"Baxtorian said you had an idea to help our defence.\"]},{\"t\":\"Fill the holes around the camp's entrance.\",\"i\":[\"Explosive potion\"]},{\"t\":\"Defend the camp.\"},{\"t\":\"Defeat Essyllt. Protect from melee. He can drain your stats, so drink super restores when needed.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear, food and potions\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Essyllt (level 236)\"]},{\"n\":\"Defeat the Fragment\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Defeat the Fragment of Seren. Protect from Ranged, and keep your distance.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Baxtorian outside of Prifddinas to finish the quest, and unlock Prifddinas!\"}],\"i\":[\"Magic combat gear, food and potions\",\"Saradomin brews\",\"Super restores\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Fragment of Seren (level 494)\"]}]}"
        "Spirits of the Elid" -> "{\"n\":\"Spirits of the Elid\",\"items\":[\"Air Rune\",\"Law Rune\",\"Needle\",\"Thread (2)\",\"Crush Weapon Style\",\"Stab Weapon Style\",\"Slash Weapon Style\",\"Light source\",\"Knife\",\"Rope\",\"Any Pickaxe\",\"Any bow\",\"Arrows for bow\"],\"rec\":[\"Combat Gear\",\"Waterskins\",\"Necklace of Passage\",\"Spear or Hasta for the 3 weapon styles\",\"Coins for magic carpet\",\"Food\"],\"enemies\":[\"Black Golem, Grey Golem, White Golem (Level 75)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"8,000 Prayer XP\",\"1,000 Thieving XP\",\"1,000 Magic XP\",\"Access to Nardah's Fountain and Shrine\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting Off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Speak to Awusah the Mayor in Nardah.\",\"s\":[\"I am an adventurer in search of quests.\",\"Any idea how you got this curse?\",\"Yes.\",\"Ok I will have a look around and see what I can do.\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Ghaslor the Elder, just north of Awusah.\",\"s\":[\"I am trying to find out the cause of this town's curse.\",\"River spirits, what are they?\"]},{\"t\":\"Open and search the cupboard in the north-west corner of the house that is north of the fountain.\"},{\"t\":\"Use the needle and thread on the torn robes (both top and bottom).\",\"i\":[\"Needle\",\"Torn Robe (bottom)\"]},{\"t\":\"Cast the Telekinetic Grab spell on the ancestral key on the table.\",\"i\":[\"Air Rune\",\"Law Rune\"]}],\"i\":[\"Air Rune\",\"Law Rune\",\"Needle\",\"Thread (2)\"]},{\"n\":\"The Golems\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Use the rope on the root to enter the cave north-west of Nardah where the river turns into a waterfall.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Equip the Robes of Elidinis and use the ancestral key on the door.\",\"i\":[\"Ancestral Key\",\"Robe of Elidinis (top)\",\"Robe of Elidinis (bottom)\"]},{\"t\":\"Open the door to the south and fight the White Golem (level-75). You can only damage the Golem with the stab attack style.\",\"i\":[\"Stab Weapon Style\"]},{\"t\":\"Clear the Water Channel then leave the room.\"},{\"t\":\"Open the door to the east and fight the Grey Golem (level-75). You can only damage the Golem with the slash attack style.\",\"i\":[\"Slash Weapon Style\"]},{\"t\":\"Open the door to the north-east and fight the Black Golem (level-75). You can only damage the Golem with the crush attack style.\",\"i\":[\"Crush Weapon Style\"]},{\"t\":\"Clear the Water Channel by shooting the target then leave the room.\",\"i\":[\"Any bow\",\"Arrows for bow\"]},{\"t\":\"Open the door to the north near the lake.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Water Spirits on the north side of the lake.\",\"s\":[\"I come as an emissary from the people of Nardah.\",\"Is there anything they can do to get their fountain working again?\"]}],\"i\":[\"Ancestral Key\",\"Robe of Elidinis (top)\",\"Robe of Elidinis (bottom)\",\"Rope\",\"Any Pickaxe\",\"Any bow\",\"Arrows for bow\",\"Crush Weapon Style\",\"Stab Weapon Style\",\"Slash Weapon Style\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"The Genie\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Nardah and speak to Awusah the Mayor.\"},{\"t\":\"Take the shoes near the doorway then leave Awusah's house.\",\"i\":[\"Shoes\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a knife on the shoes to cut out the sole.\",\"i\":[\"Knife\",\"Shoes\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the crevice to the west of Nardah.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\",\"Light source\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Genie in the Crevice.\",\"s\":[\"I'm after a statue that was thrown down here.\",\"Maybe I can make a deal for it?\",\"Ok I agree to the deal.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Genie again with the sole.\",\"i\":[\"Sole\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Nardah and use the statuette on the statuette plinth in the northern house.\",\"i\":[\"Statuette\"]}],\"i\":[\"Knife\",\"Rope\",\"Light source\"]}]}"
        "Swan Song" -> "{\"n\":\"Swan Song\",\"items\":[\"Mist rune (10)\",\"Lava rune (10)\",\"Blood rune (5)\",\"Bones (7)\",\"Pot\",\"Pot lid\",\"Iron bar (5)\",\"Any log\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Hammer (obtainable in quest)\"],\"rec\":[\"Teleport to Draynor Village\",\"Piscatoris teleport (2)\",\"Yanille teleport or Nightmare Zone minigame teleport\",\"Crafting Guild teleport\",\"Cooking gauntlets for lower burn chance on monkfish\"],\"enemies\":[\"11 Sea trolls (levels 65/79/87/101)\",\"Sea troll queen (level 170)\"],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"15,000 Magic XP\",\"10,000 Prayer XP\",\"50,000 Fishing XP\",\"25000 x Coins\",\"Access to the Piscatoris Fishing Colony\",\"The ability to fish Monkfish\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Herman Carnos outside the Fishing Colony.\",\"s\":[\"What's the rush?\",\"Do you need any help?\",\"I'm a brave adventurer! Can I try?\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Wise Old Man in Draynor Village.\",\"s\":[\"Draynor Village\",\"You used to be a famous adventurer, didn't you?\"],\"i\":[\"Blood rune (5)\",\"Lava rune (10)\",\"Mist rune (10)\"]}],\"i\":[\"Blood rune (5)\",\"Mist rune (10)\",\"Lava rune (10)\"],\"tr\":[\"Piscatoris teleport\",\"Teleport to Draynor Village\"]},{\"n\":\"Entering the colony\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to the Wise Old Man outside the Fishing Colony. Be prepared to fight sea trolls.\",\"s\":[\"I'm ready to fight.\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the sea trolls.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Herman in the east of the Fishing Colony.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Any log\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Iron bar (5)\",\"Hammer (obtainable in quest)\"],\"tr\":[\"Piscatoris teleport\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"11 Sea trolls (levels 65/79/87/101)\"]},{\"n\":\"Helping Franklin\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Franklin in the middle of the Fishing Colony.\"},{\"t\":\"Add some logs to the firebox in the building with a furnace.\",\"i\":[\"Any log\"]},{\"t\":\"Light the logs in the firebox in the building with a furnace.\",\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\"]}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Any log\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Iron bar (5)\",\"Hammer (obtainable in quest)\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Helping Arnold\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Arnold at the bank in the Fishing Colony.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"],\"r\":[\"Cooking gauntlets for lower burn chance on monkfish\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Making an army\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Wizard Frumscone in the Wizards' Guild basement.\",\"s\":[\"I'll see what the necromancer needs me to do.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Malignius Mortifer near Port Sarim.\",\"s\":[\"I need help with saving a fishing colony.\"],\"i\":[\"Bones (7)\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to a Master Crafter with dreadlocks in the Crafting Guild.\",\"s\":[\"Swan Song.\"],\"i\":[\"Brown apron\"]},{\"t\":\"Add a pot lid to a pot.\",\"i\":[\"Pot\",\"Pot lid\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the airtight pot and 7 bones to Malignius Mortifer near Port Sarim. Make sure you're equipped for the fight before speaking to Malignus.\",\"s\":[\"I've spoken to the master crafter...\"],\"i\":[\"Airtight pot\"]}],\"i\":[\"Bones (7)\",\"Pot\",\"Pot lid\",\"Ranged or melee combat gear\"],\"tr\":[\"Yanille teleport or Nightmare Zone minigame teleport\",\"Crafting Guild teleport\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Defeating the trolls\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Be prepared to fight, and talk to Herman in the colony.\",\"s\":[\"I'm ready. Let's fight!\"],\"i\":[\"Ranged or melee combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the Sea Troll Queen.\",\"s\":[\"No, I'm ready to move on with the quest.\"],\"i\":[\"Ranged or melee combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Herman to finish the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Ranged or melee combat gear\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"11 Sea trolls (levels 65/79/87/101)\",\"Sea troll queen (level 170)\"]}]}"
        "Tai Bwo Wannai Trio" -> "{\"n\":\"Tai Bwo Wannai Trio\",\"items\":[\"Coins (30)\",\"Hammer\",\"Small Fishing Net\",\"Pestle And Mortar\",\"Iron spear or better (You will lose the spear)\",\"Agility Potion (4)\",\"Ranged or Magic equipment to kill a level 3 monkey\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Sliced banana or a knife\",\"Any logs to make a fire\",\"Raw karambwan\"],\"rec\":[\"Jogre Bones\",\"Extra Raw Karambwans in case you burn the one given\",\"Any Antipoisons\",\"Stamina potions\",\"Dramen staff if you have access to fairy rings\",\"Sliced Banana (Use a knife on a banana)\",\"Food\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"2 Quest points\",\"5,000 Cooking XP\",\"5,000 Fishing XP\",\"2,500 Attack XP\",\"2,500 Strength XP\",\"2000 x Coins\",\"Ability to catch and cook Karambwans (after talking to Tinsay after the quest)\",\"Ability to use Tai Bwo Wannai teleport scrolls\",\"Ability to complete the smithing section of Barbarian Training\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting Off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Timfraku upstairs in his house in Tai Bwo Wannai.\",\"s\":[\"I am a roving adventurer.\",\"I am a travelling explorer.\",\"I am a wandering wayfarer.\",\"Who me? Oh I'm just a nobody.\",\"Trufitus sent me.\",\"Your gratitude is all I deserve.\",\"Well, some gold would be nice.\",\"So far??\",\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Hammer\",\"Small Fishing Net\",\"Pestle And Mortar\",\"Iron spear or better (You will lose the spear)\",\"Agility Potion (4)\",\"Ranged or Magic equipment to kill a level 3 monkey\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Sliced banana or a knife\",\"Any logs to make a fire\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Gathering quest materials\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Using your small fishing net, catch atleast 23 raw karambwanji just south of Tai Bwo Wannai.\",\"i\":[\"Small Fishing Net\"]},{\"t\":\"Go to Brimhaven and talk to Lubufu. You have to talk to him multiple times. You'll need to ask him twice about what he does, then talk to him to give him the karambwanji.\",\"s\":[\"Talk about him...\",\"What do you do?\",\"What do you do with your Karambwan?\",\"I could help collect the bait.\",\"You sound like you could do with the help.\",\"What do you use to catch Karambwan?\",\"Yes!\"],\"i\":[\"Or More Raw Karambwanji (20)\"]},{\"t\":\"Get a Vessel from Lubufu by asking what he uses to catch them multiple times. Drop it, and talk to him go get another, then pick up the one you dropped. You can get as many as you want but you need 2 to complete this quest.\",\"s\":[\"What do you use to catch Karambwan?\",\"Yes!\",\"Actually, I've lost my Karambwan vessel.\",\"... a shark ate it!\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a karambwanji on a karambwan Vessel to fill it.\",\"i\":[\"Or More Raw Karambwanji (23)\",\"Karambwan Vessel\"]},{\"t\":\"Go east to Musa point to buy some Karamjan rum from Zembo.\",\"i\":[\"Coins (30)\"]},{\"t\":\"Slice a banana with a knife. You can get a banana from one of the trees in the plantation.\",\"i\":[\"Knife\",\"Banana\"]},{\"t\":\"Add banana slices to the karamjan rum to make Karamjan rum with banana slices.\",\"i\":[\"Sliced Banana\",\"Karamjan Rum\"]}],\"i\":[\"Small Fishing Net\",\"Sliced banana or a knife\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Helping Tiadeche\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Tiadeche in east Karamja, near the fairy ring DKP. You can teleport off Karamja; the Karamjan rum with banana will not break.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Collecting final items\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Pickup some seaweed from Karamja's coast.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Seaweed\"]},{\"t\":\"Get some jogre bones. You can kill the jogres south of Tiadeche.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Jogre Bones\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a tinderbox on the jogre bones to set them on fire.\",\"s\":[\"Yes\"],\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\",\"Jogre Bones\"]},{\"t\":\"Wait for the bones to burn, then pick them up.\",\"i\":[\"Burnt Jogre Bones\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a pestle and mortar on a karambwanji.\",\"i\":[\"Pestle And Mortar\",\"Or More Raw Karambwanji (23)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the karambwanji paste on the burnt jogre bones.\",\"i\":[\"Karambwanji paste\",\"Burnt Jogre Bones\"]},{\"t\":\"Fish raw Karambwan next to Tiadeche with a loaded vessel or buy them from the GE.\"},{\"t\":\"RIGHT-CLICK use the bones on a fire. You can either make one yourself, or use them on the fire south of Tai Bwo Wannai.\",\"i\":[\"Pasty Jogre Bones\"]},{\"t\":\"Cook the karambwan for a poison karambwan. Note you may fail this and need to try again.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a pestle and mortar on a poison karambwan.\",\"i\":[\"Pestle And Mortar\",\"Poison karambwan\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the karambwan paste on a iron or better spear.\",\"i\":[\"Karambwan paste\",\"Iron spear or better (You will lose the spear)\"]}],\"i\":[\"Tinderbox\",\"Or More Raw Karambwanji (23)\",\"Pestle And Mortar\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Helping Tamayu and Tinsay\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Tamayu, he is located north of Shilo Village near the mining sign on the map, after watching him use your tinder box on your jogre bones and pick up the burnt jogre bones.\",\"s\":[\"When will you succeed?\",\"Yes\"]},{\"t\":\"Use an agility potion (4) on Tamayu.\",\"i\":[\"Agility Potion (4)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a poisoned spear on Tamayu.\",\"i\":[\"Iron spear or better (kp) (You will lose the spear)\"]},{\"t\":\"Go on a hunt with Tamayu.\",\"s\":[\"Take me on your next hunt for the Shaikahan.\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill a monkey to get its corpse, there are plenty of monkeys around Karamja and you will need either magic or range to kill one.\",\"i\":[\"Ranged or Magic equipment to kill a level 3 monkey\"]},{\"t\":\"Use your monkey corpse on Tamayu to have him skin it for you.\",\"i\":[\"Monkey Corpse\"]},{\"t\":\"Use your seaweed on your monkey skin to make a seaweed sandwich.\",\"i\":[\"Seaweed\",\"Monkey Skin\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Tinsay on Cairn Isle west of Shilo Village, south of fairy ring CKR. Keep talking to him, giving him the items he asks for.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the vessel on Tinsay.\",\"i\":[\"Karambwan Vessel\"]},{\"t\":\"Go back to Tiadeche located north of fairy ring DKP and use the crafting manual on him.\"}],\"i\":[\"Agility Potion (4)\",\"Iron spear or better (kp) (You will lose the spear)\",\"Karamjan Rum (with banana slices)\",\"Marinated Jogre Bones\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Finishing the quest\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go to Timfraku's house to finish the quest.\"}],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Tale of the Righteous" -> "{\"n\":\"Tale of the Righteous\",\"items\":[\"A pickaxe\",\"Runes for a few casts of a combat spell\",\"Any ranged weapon + ammo\",\"Rope\"],\"rec\":[\"Xeric's Talisman\",\"Antipoison for lizardmen\"],\"enemies\":[\"Corrupt Lizardman (level 46)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"8000 x Coins\",\"A Memoir Page\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Phileas Rimor in Shayzien.\",\"s\":[\"Do you need help with anything?\",\"Yes.\",\"What do you need?\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Discovery\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Bring a melee weapon, ranged weapon, and runes for magic attacks and talk to Archeio in the Arceuus Library.\",\"s\":[\"Yes please!\"],\"i\":[\"Any ranged weapon + ammo\",\"Runes for a few casts of a combat spell\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Pagida in the Library Historical Archive.\",\"s\":[\"I have a question about King Shayzien VII.\",\"Yes please.\"]},{\"t\":\"Solve the crystal puzzle.\"},{\"t\":\"Investigate the skeleton in the north cell.\"},{\"t\":\"Report back to Phileas Rimor in Shayzien.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Shiro upstairs in the War Tent located on the west side of the Shayzien Encampment.\"}],\"i\":[\"Any ranged weapon + ammo\",\"Runes for a few casts of a combat spell\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Investigate Quidamortem\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Travel to Mount Quidamortem and talk to Historian Duffy.\"},{\"t\":\"Use a rope on the crevice west side of Quidamortem.\",\"i\":[\"Rope\",\"A pickaxe\",\"Combat gear for a level 46 corrupt lizardman\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the crevice west side of Quidamortem, ready to fight a corrupted lizardman (level 46).\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"A pickaxe\",\"Combat gear for a level 46 corrupt lizardman\"]},{\"t\":\"Mine the rockfall.\",\"i\":[\"A pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Push the boulder further along the path.\"},{\"t\":\"Attempt to enter the magic gate to the south room. You will need to kill the corrupted lizardman who appears.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the Unstable Altar in the south room.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Historian Duffy.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the crevice west side of Quidamortem again.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Historian Duffy near the Unstable Altar.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Gnosi near the Unstable Altar.\"}],\"i\":[\"Rope\",\"A pickaxe\",\"Combat gear for a level 46 corrupt lizardman\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Finishing off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Return to Shiro upstairs in the War Tent located on the west side of the Shayzien Encampment.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Phileas Rimor's house in Shayzien.\"},{\"t\":\"Return to Shiro upstairs in the War Tent in west Shayzien to complete the quest.\"}]}]}"
        "Tears of Guthix" -> "{\"n\":\"Tears of Guthix\",\"items\":[\"Rope\",\"Sapphire lantern\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Chisel\",\"Any pickaxe\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"1,000 Crafting XP\",\"Access to Tears of Guthix\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Making a bowl\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Enter the hole to Lumbridge swamp.\",\"i\":[\"Sapphire lantern\",\"Chisel\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Tinderbox\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the cave in the south east corner of the swamp.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Juna.\",\"s\":[\"Okay...\"]},{\"t\":\"Go back up the rocks and use the lit sapphire lantern on one of the light creatures nearby.\",\"i\":[\"Sapphire lantern\"]},{\"t\":\"Mine one of the rocks.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Use a chisel on the magic stone.\",\"i\":[\"Chisel\",\"Magic stone\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Juna to complete the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Rope\",\"Sapphire lantern\",\"Tinderbox\",\"Chisel\",\"Any pickaxe\"],\"c\":0}]}"
        "Temple of Ikov" -> "{\"n\":\"Temple of Ikov\",\"items\":[\"Yew, magic, dark bow, or thrown ranged weapons (darts, knives, thrownaxes)\",\"Limpwurt (unnoted) (20)\",\"Knife to get the boots of lightness\",\"A light source to get the boots of lightness\"],\"rec\":[],\"enemies\":[\"Able to survive multiple aggressive spiders (level 61) and demons (level 82)\",\"Fire Warrior of Lesarkus (level 84) with ranged\",\"If siding with Lucien, Guardian of Armadyl (level 43)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"10,500 Ranged XP\",\"8,000 Fletching XP\",\"Boots of Lightness\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Lucien in the pub north of East Ardougne castle.\",\"s\":[\"I'm a mighty hero!\",\"That sounds like a laugh!\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Defeat Lesarkus\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Get your weight below 0kg. You can get boots of lightness from the Temple of Ikov north of East Ardougne for -4.5kg.\",\"i\":[\"Pendant of lucien\",\"Limpwurt (unnoted) (20)\",\"Yew, magic, dark bow, or thrown ranged weapons (darts, knives, thrownaxes)\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the Temple of Ikov north of East Ardougne.\",\"i\":[\"Pendant of lucien\",\"Yew, magic, dark bow, or thrown ranged weapons (darts, knives, thrownaxes)\",\"Limpwurt (unnoted) (20)\"]},{\"t\":\"Go down the west stairs to get boots of lightness.\",\"i\":[\"A light source to get the boots of lightness\",\"Knife to get the boots of lightness\"]},{\"t\":\"Get the boots of lightness in the north east corner.\",\"i\":[\"Boots of lightness\"]},{\"t\":\"Go back upstairs.\"},{\"t\":\"Cross the bridge in the north room and pick up the lever whilst weighing less than 0kg.\",\"i\":[\"Pendant of lucien\",\"Lever\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the lever on the lever bracket in the entrance room.\",\"i\":[\"Lever\"]},{\"t\":\"Pull the lever.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the south gate.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the chests in the ice area of this room until you have at least 20 Ice Arrows or more to be safe. If using a throwable weapon (darts, knives) a single Ice Arrow is sufficient. A random chest has the arrows each time.\",\"i\":[\"Sufficient Arrows\"]},{\"t\":\"Return back to the entry room when you have enough arrows.\"},{\"t\":\"Go into the north room, then on the north side right-click search the lever there for traps, then pull it.\"},{\"t\":\"Try to enter the far north door. Be prepared to fight Lesarkus, who can only be hurt by ice arrows.\",\"i\":[\"Yew, magic, dark bow, or thrown ranged weapons (darts, knives, thrownaxes)\",\"Ice arrows\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the Fire Warrior of Lesarkus. He can only be hurt by the ice arrows.\",\"i\":[\"Yew, magic, dark bow, or thrown ranged weapons (darts, knives, thrownaxes)\",\"Ice arrows\"]}],\"i\":[\"Pendant of lucien\",\"Yew, magic, dark bow, or thrown ranged weapons (darts, knives, thrownaxes)\",\"Knife to get the boots of lightness\",\"A light source to get the boots of lightness\",\"Limpwurt (unnoted) (20)\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Fire Warrior of Lesarkus (level 84) with ranged\"]},{\"n\":\"Explore deeper\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Go all the way north and talk to Winelda there.\",\"i\":[\"Pendant of lucien\",\"Limpwurt (unnoted) (20)\"]},{\"t\":\"Give Winelda 20 unnoted limpwurts.\",\"i\":[\"Limpwurt (unnoted) (20)\"]},{\"t\":\"Follow the path around past the skeletons and lesser demons until you find a shiny key. Pick it up.\",\"i\":[\"Shiny key\"]},{\"t\":\"Push the wall on the north side of this area.\"},{\"t\":\"You can now choose to either help Lucien or help the Guardians of Armadyl. To help Lucien, simply pick up the Staff of Armadyl. To help the guardians, remove the pendant of lucien and talk to one of them.\",\"s\":[\"I seek the Staff of Armadyl.\",\"Lucien will give me a grand reward for it!\",\"You're right, it's time for my yearly bath.\",\"Ok! I'll help!\"]},{\"t\":\"Either return to Lucien west of the Grand Exchange with the Staff of Armadyl, or kill him whilst wearing the Pendant of Armadyl.\"}]}]}"
        "Temple of the Eye" -> "{\"n\":\"Temple of the Eye\",\"items\":[\"Bucket of water\",\"Chisel\",\"Pickaxe\"],\"rec\":[\"Teleport to Varrock\",\"Teleport to Al Kharid\"],\"enemies\":[],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"9,210 Runecraft XP\",\"Medium pouch\",\"Access to the Guardians of the Rift minigame\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"An Eye for a Favour\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Wizard Persten east of the Al Kharid gate.\",\"s\":[\"What's a wizard doing in Al Kharid?\",\"Yes.\"]}],\"i\":[\"Teleport to Varrock\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Herbert and the Dark Mage\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Mage of Zamorak in the Varrock chaos temple.\",\"s\":[\"I need your help with an amulet.\"],\"i\":[\"Eye Amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Tea Seller near the Varrock east gate.\",\"s\":[\"Could I have a strong cup of tea?\"]},{\"t\":\"Give the strong tea to the Mage of Zamorak in the Varrock chaos temple.\",\"s\":[\"Could you help me with that amulet now?\",\"Yes.\",\"Could you help me with that amulet now?\"],\"i\":[\"Strong Cup of Tea\",\"Bucket of water\",\"Eye Amulet\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Dark Mage in the Abyss.\",\"s\":[\"I need your help with an amulet.\"],\"i\":[\"Bucket of water\",\"Eye Amulet\"]}],\"i\":[\"Bucket of water\",\"Eye Amulet\"],\"tr\":[\"Teleport to Al Kharid\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Help from Some Wizards\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Wizard Persten east of the Al Kharid gate.\",\"s\":[\"About that incantation...\"],\"i\":[\"Eye Amulet\",\"Abyssal Incantation\"]},{\"t\":\"Bring the Abyssal Incantation to Sedridor in the Wizard Tower's basement.\",\"s\":[\"I need your help with an incantation.\"],\"i\":[\"Abyssal Incantation\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Wizard Traiborn on the Wizards' Tower 1st floor.\",\"s\":[\"I need your apprentices to help with an incantation.\"]},{\"t\":\"Get puzzle from Apprentice Felix.\"},{\"t\":\"Get puzzle from Apprentice Tamara.\"},{\"t\":\"Get puzzle from Apprentice Cordelia.\"},{\"t\":\"Tell Wizard Traiborn the solution to his puzzle is: 11\",\"s\":[\"I think I know what a thingummywut is!\"]}],\"i\":[\"Abyssal Incantation\"],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Enter the Gate\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Speak to Archmage Sedridor in the Wizard's Tower basement.\"},{\"t\":\"Speak to Archmage Sedridor to begin the incantation.\",\"s\":[\"Let's do it.\",\"So we're ready to perform the incantation?\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the Temple of the Eye.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Apprentice Felix.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Apprentice Tamara.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Apprentice Cordelia.\"},{\"t\":\"Speak with Wizard Persten.\"},{\"t\":\"Experience the vision.\"},{\"t\":\"Debrief with Wizard Persten and the apprentices.\"}],\"c\":0},{\"n\":\"Guardians of the Rift\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Complete the Guardians of the Rift tutorial.\",\"i\":[\"Pickaxe\",\"Chisel\"]},{\"t\":\"Speak to Archmage Sedridor in the Wizard's Tower basement to finish the quest.\"}],\"i\":[\"Pickaxe\",\"Chisel\"],\"c\":0}]}"
        "The Ascent of Arceuus" -> "{\"n\":\"The Ascent of Arceuus\",\"items\":[],\"rec\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Access to Fairy Rings\",\"Battlefront teleports (2)\",\"Xeric's Talisman\",\"Skills necklace\"],\"enemies\":[\"5 Tormented Souls (level 16)\",\"Trapped Soul (level 30)\"],\"rewards\":[\"1 Quest point\",\"1,500 Hunter XP\",\"500 Runecraft XP\",\"2000 x Coins\",\"A Kharedst's Memoirs page\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Mori in Arceuus.\",\"s\":[\"What can I do to help?\",\"We should let someone know about this.\",\"Yes.\",\"Of course I'll help.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Councillor Andrews in Kourend Castle.\",\"s\":[\"There's been a death in Arceuus.\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Mori in Arceuus.\",\"s\":[\"What should we do now?\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the Tower of Magic in Arceuus, ready to fight some level 16 Tormented Souls.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Defeat the tormented souls.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Go up the stairs in the Tower of Magic.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lord Trobin Arceuus.\"}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"5 Tormented Souls (level 16)\"]},{\"n\":\"Freeing a Soul\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Kaal-Ket-Jor.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the ancient grave south of Mount Karuulm.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Inspect plants and bushes until you uncover the full path.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the final plant and kill the Trapped Soul (level 30) which appears.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Kaal-Ket-Jor.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Trapped Soul (level 30)\"]},{\"n\":\"Saving Arceuus\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Inspect the rocks near the Arceuus Altar until you find a device.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Lord Trobin Arceuus to finish the quest.\"}]}]}"
        "The Blood Moon Rises" -> arrayOf(
            "{\"n\":\"The Blood Moon Rises\",\"items\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Vyre noble outfit\"],\"rec\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Stamina potion\",\"Drakan's medallion\"],\"enemies\":[\"Vyrewatch (lvl 103)\",\"Vyrewatch Sentinel (lvl 151)\",\"Monk of Zamorak (lvl 34)\",\"Sanguidae (lvl 106)\",\"Venator (lvl 195)\",\"Ancient feral vyre (lvl 89)\",\"Nylocas (lvl 46, 82, 104)\",\"The Maiden of Sugadinti (lvl 340)\",\"Nylocas Vasilias (lvl 323)\",\"Wyrd (lvl 564)\",\"Lowerniel Drakan (lvl 927, 1063)\"],\"rewards\":[\"4 Quest points\",\"6 x 30,000 Experience Tomes (Any skill above 70)\",\"Sunspear\",\"Access to Vampyrium\",\"Access to Veliaf's pub in Burgh de Rott\",\"Vyres of morytania are now friendly to you without wearing a vyre noble outfit\"],\"sec\":[{\"n\":\"Starting off\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Sarius Guile in the Icyene Graveyard to start the quest.\",\"s\":[\"Icyene Graveyard.\",\"Yes.\"]},{\"t\":\"Look for Ivan in the Myreque Hideout below Old Man Ral's home in Meiyerditch.\"},{\"t\":\"Inspect the makeshift shrine in the Myreque Hideout below Old Man Ral's home in Meiyerditch.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan in the Myreque Hideout below Old Man Ral's home in Meiyerditch while wearing the vyre noble outfit, ready for a fight.\",\"s\":[\"Are you ready to go to Darkmeyer?\",\"I'm ready.\"],\"i\":[\"Vyre noble outfit\",\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill the vyrewatches and defend Ivan Strom until he can teleport you both out. Kill the approaching acidic bloodvelds with a ranged weapon. Prioritize the Vyrewatch Sentinels.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan in the Myreque Hideout below Old Man Ral's home in Meiyerditch after escaping.\"}],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Fast ranged weapon\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Vyre noble outfit\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Vyrewatch (lvl 103)\",\"Vyrewatch Sentinel (lvl 151)\"]},{\"n\":\"Finding Veliaf\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan Strom in the graveyard outside the Slepe church.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Roy the bartender in Slepe and ask him about Veliaf's whereabouts.\",\"s\":[\"We're looking for a friend of ours.\"]},{\"t\":\"Head to the Crombwick Manor through the church dungeon.\"},{\"t\":\"Help Veliaf kill the vampyres in Crombwick Manor.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Veliaf after helping him kill the vampyres in Crombwick Manor.\"}],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"The Writings\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk with Ivan in the Paterdomus dungeon.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the Squire's journal Ivan just gave you.\",\"i\":[\"Squire's journal\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk with Ivan again after reading the Squire's journal.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the monks of zamorak on the ground floor of the Paterdomus temple.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan Storm on the first floor of the Paterdomus temple.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan Strom after solving the puzzle.\"},{\"t\":\"Read Ivandis' writings.\",\"i\":[\"Ivandis' writings\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan Strom after reading Ivandis' writings.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\"],\"c\":1},{\"n\":\"Infiltrating Castle Drakan\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Stock up on combat gear and supplies, then head to Ivandis' tomb with Ivan Strom.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Investigate the blockage just south west of Ivandis' coffin.\"},{\"t\":\"Mine the blockage just south west of Ivandis' coffin.\",\"i\":[\"Any pickaxe\"]},{\"t\":\"Head through the cave entrance just south west of Ivandis' coffin, ready for a fight.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Head into the daeyalt processing room through the tunnel to the north-east.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill vampyres. Focus on the Vyrewatch Sentinels. Avoid the Blood orb. Lure Vyrewatches into the Blood orbs to deal massive damage to them.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan after killing the vampyres.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the Castle Drakan cellars through the entry to the north.\"},{\"t\":\"Climb up the stairs to the Castle Drakan lobby.\"},{\"t\":\"Pray at the shrine to let your Drakan's Medallion teleport you here.\",\"i\":[\"Drakan's medallion\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the ominous red portal in the Castle Drakan lobby.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Melee combat gear\"]}],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Any pickaxe\",\"Drakan's medallion\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Vyrewatch (lvl 103)\",\"Vyrewatch Sentinel (lvl 151)\"]},{\"n\":\"Let the hunt begin\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Leave Castle Drakan.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick up the crank wheel from the house east of the altar, north-west of where you started after the cutscene.\",\"i\":[\"Crank wheel\"]},{\"t\":\"Spam click the crank base outside the house to the north west. Drakan will start chasing you. Run away if he gets too close.\",\"i\":[\"Crank wheel\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the house north of the crank base.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the bookshelf in the house north of the crank base for a dusty book, then read it to retrieve the vitur key.\"},{\"t\":\"Read the dusty book and retrieve the vitur key.\",\"i\":[\"Dusty book\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the north-eastern vitur manor and search the shed in the north-eastern room for a pair of bolt cutters.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter the building east of the altar and pick up the tooth half of key from the table.\",\"i\":[\"Tooth half of key\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the house with the chained door, south of the well, and pick up the loop half of key from the table.\",\"i\":[\"Loop half of key\"]},{\"t\":\"Combine the loop and tooth half of key into the myrmel key.\",\"i\":[\"Loop half of key\",\"Tooth half of key\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the bucket from the house with the myrmel door, east of the well.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the bucket on the well outside the house.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to the myrmel house with the bucket of water.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket of water\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the bucket of water on the northern barrel to retrieve the shadum key.\",\"i\":[\"Bucket of water\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the trapdoor key from the shadum house south-west of the drawbridge.\",\"i\":[\"Trapdoor key\"]},{\"t\":\"Spam click the crank base in the bank.\",\"i\":[\"Trapdoor key\",\"Crank wheel\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the bank north-west of the well.\",\"i\":[\"Myrmel key\",\"Trapdoor key\",\"Crank wheel\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the trapdoor.\",\"i\":[\"Trapdoor key\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the chest in the western room of the altar house.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the altar room, then head to the smithy in the south-west.\",\"i\":[\"Jovkai key\"]},{\"t\":\"Pick up the old cog from the table in the smithy in the south-west.\",\"i\":[\"Old cog\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Vanescula by the drawbridge to the south-east. Drakan will chase you when you leave the smithy.\",\"i\":[\"Old cog\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Vanescula by the drawbridge to the south-east when you're ready to leave. Drakan will chase you through the woods. Dodge his attacks, protect from melee.\",\"i\":[\"Old cog\"]}]},{\"n\":\"Escaping the forest\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Learn to fight Lowerniel Drakan. Protect from melee and dodge his attacks. During this tutorial segment, there will be glimmering sparks that attempt to show you where to click to dodge his attacks.\"},{\"t\":\"Resupply at the shelter remains in the middle. When you've resupplied, click the trees to continue.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the ancient feral vyres. They swap positions and heal, so try to focus one at a time.\"},{\"t\":\"Enter Darkwood trees to continue.\"},{\"t\":\"Make your way through the tangle of trees to the darkwood trees in the north-east, chopping down and climbing over trees on the way. Trees can only be chopped once per direction.\"},{\"t\":\"Turn off run. Avoid the Maxilla beasts. Running nearby, walking within 2 tiles, or standing on the maxilla beast will cause them to attack you and probably kill you.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave through the cave in the south-east.\"},{\"t\":\"Continue through the cave.\"},{\"t\":\"Kill the nylocas. Gray ones with melee, yellow ones with a ranged weapon. You can pick up the Spine near the Venator corpse to use as darts. If you do not kill them fast enough, they explode dealing 15 damage.\"},{\"t\":\"When all nylocas are dead, leave through the trees.\"},{\"t\":\"Wrangle the snakes, then combine them into one long snake. You must stand behind the snake when attempting to wrangle it.\",\"i\":[\"Dead blood serpent (3)\"]},{\"t\":\"Combine the snakes into one long snake.\",\"i\":[\"Dead blood serpent (3)\"]},{\"t\":\"Use the serpent rope on the long branched tree.\",\"i\":[\"Serpent rope\"]},{\"t\":\"Swing across the water with your newly created swing.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave through the trees.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to the Mysterious Woman.\"}],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Venator (lvl 195)\",\"Ancient feral vyre (lvl 89)\",\"Nylocas (lvl 46, 82, 104)\",\"Lowerniel Drakan (lvl 927, 1063)\"]},{\"n\":\"Curing Safalaan\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Efaritay Hallow in the west room to help her with her son.\"},{\"t\":\"Pick some amitire leaves from the amitire plant outside the palace.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the shelves next to the sink for a bowl.\",\"i\":[\"Amitire leaves\"]},{\"t\":\"Fill the bowl with water.\",\"i\":[\"Amitire leaves\",\"Bowl\"]},{\"t\":\"Take a potato from the cupboard.\",\"s\":[\"Potato.\"],\"i\":[\"Amitire leaves\",\"Bowl of water\"]},{\"t\":\"Put the potato in the bowl of water.\",\"i\":[\"Amitire leaves\",\"Bowl of water\",\"Potato\"]},{\"t\":\"Take some raw meat the cupboard.\",\"s\":[\"Raw meat.\"],\"i\":[\"Amitire leaves\",\"Incomplete stew\"]},{\"t\":\"Cook the raw meat on the range.\",\"i\":[\"Amitire leaves\",\"Incomplete stew\",\"Raw impaler meat\"]},{\"t\":\"Put the cooked meat in the incomplete stew.\",\"i\":[\"Amitire leaves\",\"Incomplete stew\",\"Cooked meat\"]},{\"t\":\"Cook the stew on the range.\",\"i\":[\"Uncooked stew\"]},{\"t\":\"Put the amitire leaves into the stew.\",\"i\":[\"Amitire leaves\",\"Stew\"]},{\"t\":\"Give the amitire stew to Safalaan Hallow.\",\"i\":[\"Amitire stew\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Safalaan Hallow after feeding him the stew.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Efaritay Hallow after feeding Safalaan the stew.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Gearing up\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Search the workbench in the east room for a hammer.\",\"s\":[\"Hammer.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the workbench in the east room for a chisel.\",\"s\":[\"Chisel.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Hammer\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the workbench in the east room for a knife.\",\"s\":[\"Knife.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Hammer\",\"Chisel\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the northern-most crate for some blisterwood logs.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Hammer\",\"Chisel\",\"Knife\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the eastern-most crate for a blessed silver sickle.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Hammer\",\"Chisel\",\"Knife\",\"Blisterwood logs\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the eastern-most chest for a diamond.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Hammer\",\"Chisel\",\"Knife\",\"Blisterwood logs\",\"Silver sickle (b)\"]},{\"t\":\"Put the unenchanted diamond on the blessed silver sickle.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Hammer\",\"Chisel\",\"Knife\",\"Blisterwood logs\",\"Silver sickle (b)\",\"Diamond\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the western-most chest for a diamond tablet.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Hammer\",\"Chisel\",\"Knife\",\"Blisterwood logs\",\"Diamond sickle (b)\"]},{\"t\":\"Enchant the diamond sickle with the enchant diamond tablet.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Hammer\",\"Chisel\",\"Knife\",\"Blisterwood logs\",\"Diamond sickle (b)\",\"Enchant diamond\"]},{\"t\":\"Combine the blisterwood logs with your newly created enchanted diamond sickle to create an enhanced blisterwood sickle.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Hammer\",\"Knife\",\"Blisterwood logs\",\"Enchanted diamond sickle (b)\"]},{\"t\":\"Smith a hallowed flail at the anvil.\",\"s\":[\"Yes.\"],\"i\":[\"Blisterwood flail\",\"Hammer\",\"Blisterwood sickle (e)\",\"Hallowed marks\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan Strom after smithing the hallowed flail.\"},{\"t\":\"Search the workbench for a knife.\",\"s\":[\"Knife.\"]},{\"t\":\"Search the northern-most crate for some blisterwood logs to craft stakes.\"},{\"t\":\"Fletch the logs into stakes.\",\"i\":[\"Blisterwood logs\",\"Knife\"]},{\"t\":\"Return to Ivan Strom after crafting some stakes. You can craft more before continuing if you want to use them during the upcoming fights.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Veliaf in the dungeon.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Vanescula Drakan.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Veliaf in the dungeon again.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Sugadinti Vitur after helping out Ivan and Veliaf.\"}]},{\"n\":\"Guarding the palace\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Get ready for combat. Resupply at the supply table in the kitchen if needed. Speak to the Aranei next to the table if you want to deposit any items into your bank. Then leave the palace.\"},{\"t\":\"Protect the palace. Attack the portals in the sky.\"},{\"t\":\"Leave the palace.\"},{\"t\":\"Heal fallen Aranei, repair damaged windows, and repair damaged pillars.\"},{\"t\":\"Fight Lowerniel Drakan. Protect from melee and dodge his attacks. Dodge at least one tile opposite of the telegraphed motion. When he holds his spear back, step to his side.\"},{\"t\":\"Watch the cutscene.\"}],\"i\":[\"Hallowed flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Drakan's medallion\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Lowerniel Drakan (lvl 927, 1063)\"]},{\"n\":\"Night at the theatre\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan Strom in the haunted woods.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Veliaf Hurtz in the Burgh de Rott Myreque base.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Sugadinti Vitur in Burgh de Rott.\"},{\"t\":\"Gear up for theatre of blood. Bring melee gear with a range and mage switch, some food & potions, then talk to Sugadinti Vitur in front of the theatre of blood.\",\"s\":[\"I'm ready.\"],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Kill Nylocas with the correct fighting style. Fight the Maiden of Sugadinti, killing healers when they spawn. Avoid blood puddles on the ground.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Sugadinti Vitur.\"}],\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Drakan's medallion\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Nylocas (lvl 46, 82, 104)\",\"The Maiden of Sugadinti (lvl 340)\"]},{\"n\":\"Safalaan's fate\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Head to the abandoned building north-east of Burgh de Rott and talk to Veliaf.\",\"i\":[\"Combat gear\",\"Hallowed flail\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\"]},{\"t\":\"Head to the abandoned building north-east of Burgh de Rott and enter the entry.\"},{\"t\":\"Fight the Wyrd. Protect from melee against the normal attacks, and turn it off when it screeches similar to a Venator. First phase: He will punch twice, then unleash a screech attack. After screeching twice, he will smash the ground matching which hand he hit you with the two most recent punches. Second phase: Instead of the screech attach, he will use a lightning attack that spawns blood pools around you. These pools disappear over time. Turn off your protection prayer and leave his area, avoiding any pools.\"},{\"t\":\"Search for the escaped wyrd. Inspect the fence north of barrows.\"}],\"i\":[\"Hallowed flail\",\"Combat gear\",\"Good healing food\",\"Prayer potions\",\"Drakan's medallion\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Venator (lvl 195)\",\"Wyrd (lvl 564)\"]},{\"n\":\"Night of the blood moon\",\"st\":[{\"t\":\"Talk to Veliaf Hurtz in the Burgh de Rott hideout.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Sugadinti Vitur in the Burgh de Rott hideout, ready for another fight against Drakan.\",\"s\":[\"I'm ready.\"]},{\"t\":\"Fight Lowerniel Drakan. Protect from melee and dodge his attacks. Dodge at least one tile opposite of the telegraphed motion. When he holds his spear back, step to his side.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Veliaf Hurtz.\",\"s\":[\"I'll go now.\"]},{\"t\":\"Talk to Ivan Strom inside Castle Drakan.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Sugadinti Vitur inside Castle Drakan.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Efaritay Hallow in Icyene Graveyard.\",\"s\":[\"Icyene Graveyard.\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the portal in Icyene Graveyard to get to Vampyrium, ready for the final confrontation.\",\"i\":[\"Hallowed flail\",\"Melee combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Enter the door, ready to fight Drakan. You can get supplies and deposit items at the chest next to the door.\",\"i\":[\"Hallowed flail\",\"Melee combat gear\"]},{\"t\":\"Fight Lowerniel Drakan. Protect from melee and dodge his attacks. Dodge at least one tile opposite of the telegraphed motion. When he holds his spear back, step to his side. Dodge over the blood waves. Protect from magic when he shoots his blood spears. Avoid shadows and blood pools on the ground. Step behind him when he raises his spear above his shoulder. When he rushes around you, dodge in the direction of his first cloud.\"},{\"t\":\"Talk to Efaritay Ha",
            "llow in the icyene graveyard.\"},{\"t\":\"Congratulations on finishing the quest!\"}],\"i\":[\"Hallowed flail\",\"Combat gear\"],\"c\":1,\"e\":[\"Lowerniel Drakan (lvl 927, 1063)\"]}]}"
